{
    "title": "Flashfood\u2014Grocery deals",
    "description": "Real food, realer prices. Flashfood gives you unbeatable deals on groceries at peak deliciousness. Want to save big on fruit, vegetables, meat, milk, cheese, pantry staples* and more? Skip the coupons, get the Flashfood app. Convenient same-day pick up.\r\n\r\n\u2028\u2028********\u2028\r\n\r\nALWAYS SOMETHING NEW \ud83e\uded0\r\nWith fresh deals added daily, you\u2019ll find go-to staples and new foods to discover. From chicken wings to crab cakes, kiwis to strawberries*, Flashfood helps you switch up your meals. And if you don\u2019t see your find today \u2014 check back tomorrow. We might surprise you.\r\n\r\n\u2028THE FRESHEST DEALS IN TOWN \ud83e\udd6c\u2028\r\nWe partner with major grocery stores like Meijer, GIANT and Stop & Shop to score you savings close to home. Same-day pick up, no long lines \u2014 just unbeatable deals. The real question is: how will you fit it all in the fridge?\u2028\r\n\r\nWHO SHOULD USE FLASHFOOD? \ud83d\ude0b\r\nPeople who eat food. That\u2019s who. And people who love a great deal. And a great meal. \r\n\r\nHOW DOES IT WORK? WE\u2019RE GLAD YOU ASKED \ud83d\udc99\r\n1. Download Flashfood and create an account\r\n2. Browse grocery deals at nearby stores\r\n3. Add items to your cart and buy in the app\r\n4. Pick up your haul from the Flashfood Zone at your local partner store\r\n\r\nWARNING: Upon finding your first amazing flash deal, spontaneous dancing for joy may occur. \ud83c\udf89\ud83c\udf89\ud83c\udf89\u2028\r\n\r\nWHAT\u2019S THE CATCH? \ud83e\udd84\r\nThere\u2019s no catch! Grocers are working hard to ensure food ends up on dinner tables, not in landfills. By selling meat, produce, and prepared foods at up 50% off on Flashfood, our partners ensure that surplus items \u2013 whether seasonal, overstocked, or nearing expiration \u2014 end up on dinner tables, not in the landfill. \r\n\r\n********\u2028\u2028*\r\n\r\nItem selection varies by store. Terms and conditions apply. See details: flashfood.com/terms\r\n\r\n\u2028\u2028Need help? We\u2019re here. Reach out on live chat from the app or email us at support@flashfood.com.\r\n\r\n\u2028We care about your privacy (for real). Read about it at flashfood.com/privacy \r\n\r\nTo learn more about our impact, where we operate, and our plans for the future, visit flashfood.com.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Real food, realer prices. Flashfood gives you unbeatable deals on groceries at peak deliciousness. Want to save big on fruit, vegetables, meat, milk, cheese, pantry staples* and more? Skip the coupons, get the Flashfood app. Convenient same-day pick up.<br><br>\u2028\u2028********\u2028<br><br>ALWAYS SOMETHING NEW \ud83e\uded0<br>With fresh deals added daily, you\u2019ll find go-to staples and new foods to discover. From chicken wings to crab cakes, kiwis to strawberries*, Flashfood helps you switch up your meals. And if you don\u2019t see your find today \u2014 check back tomorrow. We might surprise you.<br><br>\u2028THE FRESHEST DEALS IN TOWN \ud83e\udd6c\u2028<br>We partner with major grocery stores like Meijer, GIANT and Stop &amp; Shop to score you savings close to home. Same-day pick up, no long lines \u2014 just unbeatable deals. The real question is: how will you fit it all in the fridge?\u2028<br><br>WHO SHOULD USE FLASHFOOD? \ud83d\ude0b<br>People who eat food. That\u2019s who. And people who love a great deal. And a great meal. <br><br>HOW DOES IT WORK? WE\u2019RE GLAD YOU ASKED \ud83d\udc99<br>1. Download Flashfood and create an account<br>2. Browse grocery deals at nearby stores<br>3. Add items to your cart and buy in the app<br>4. Pick up your haul from the Flashfood Zone at your local partner store<br><br>WARNING: Upon finding your first amazing flash deal, spontaneous dancing for joy may occur. \ud83c\udf89\ud83c\udf89\ud83c\udf89\u2028<br><br>WHAT\u2019S THE CATCH? \ud83e\udd84<br>There\u2019s no catch! Grocers are working hard to ensure food ends up on dinner tables, not in landfills. By selling meat, produce, and prepared foods at up 50% off on Flashfood, our partners ensure that surplus items \u2013 whether seasonal, overstocked, or nearing expiration \u2014 end up on dinner tables, not in the landfill. <br><br>********\u2028\u2028*<br><br>Item selection varies by store. Terms and conditions apply. See details: flashfood.com/terms<br><br>\u2028\u2028Need help? We\u2019re here. Reach out on live chat from the app or email us at support@flashfood.com.<br><br>\u2028We care about your privacy (for real). Read about it at flashfood.com/privacy <br><br>To learn more about our impact, where we operate, and our plans for the future, visit flashfood.com.",
